Electron adaptation notes (42-x-y):
Applied on top of the 'Limit max image allocation size to 1GB'
prerequisite. Limitations::maxTextureBytes stays at the prerequisite's 1
GB value (upstream later raised it to 1.25 GB); only the
roundUp3DTextureSizeToPOTForLimit member was added. The
ValidateTexStorage() hunk was dropped because that function does not
exist on this branch; the branch's TexStorage validation paths call
ValidImageAllocationSize(), which carries the rounding.

